## BlogListBySlug

Visa lista med bloggartiklar

- title - text som visas ovanför listan
- slugs - lista av dom slugs som ska visas i listan

{% BlogListBySlug
   slugs=["mtbo-oringen-smalandskusten-2024", "en/mtbo-oringen-smalandskusten-2024"] /%}

---

## Youtube Video

Visa en YouTube video, använder astro-embed, https://astro-embed.netlify.app/

- videoid - bara id, inte hela URLen
- title - videons titel som visas över preview bilden

{% YoutubeVideo
   videoid="55xp2cryPfE"
   title="Maydeus the Cyclist - MTBO (Mountain Bike Orienteering)" /%}

---

## Leaflet Map

Visa en karta med markörer, områden (polygons) och spår/banor (polylines).

**Available colors**: blue (default), red, green, orange, purple, grey
**Available icons**: default (●), start (▶), finish (■), parking (P), info (i)

{% LeafletMap
   markers=[
     {lat: 59.163, lng: 18.130241, title: "Event Center", url: "https://eventor.orientering.se/Events/Show/54359", color: "red", icon: "info"},
     {lat: 59.165, lng: 18.128, title: "Etapp 1 - Start", url: "https://eventor.orientering.se/Events/Show/54359", color: "green", icon: "start"},
     {lat: 59.161, lng: 18.135, title: "Etapp 2", url: "https://eventor.orientering.se/Events/Show/54359", color: "blue", icon: "default"},
     {lat: 59.168, lng: 18.132, title: "Etapp 3 - Finish", url: "https://eventor.orientering.se/Events/Show/54359", color: "orange", icon: "finish"},
     {lat: 59.16, lng: 18.125, title: "Parking", url: "https://eventor.orientering.se/Events/Show/54359", color: "purple", icon: "parking"}
   ]
   zoom=12
   height="400px" /%}

