## Smart Resource Lists

Automatic styling of lists containing resource links. Even mixed lists are handled!

### Auto Detected

- [Livelox Event (Auto)](https://www.livelox.com/Events/Show/12345)
- [PDF Document (Auto)](wmtboc26/selbacksvagen.pdf)
- [Eventor SWE (Auto)](https://eventor.orientering.se/Events/Show/12345)
- [Eventor IOF (Auto)](https://eventor.orienteering.org/Events/Show/8278)
- [Eventor NOR (Auto)](https://eventor.orientering.no/Events/Show/456)

### Mixed List

- **O-Ringen's officiella webbplats:** [https://oringen.se/](https://oringen.se/)
- O-Ringen: [https://oringen.se/](https://oringen.se/)
- [Livelox Event](https://www.livelox.com/Events/Show/12345)
- [Just a normal internal link](/about)
- [External Google Link](https://google.com)
- Just some plain text
